{"4158790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bargalian Regicide", "steam_appid": 4158790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/eef526f750e602e0f0d7299dde8d397a.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.poster.avif?t=1774924048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.webm?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.mp4?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heir to the throne prince Vile has spent nine years imprisoned in the Underkeep on charge of Regicide. In that time, the Bargalian Empire has fallen into the hands of the War Council. Only now does an ancient and powerful being called Talurbas rise to bring about great upheaval. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/991049d590c17c6e94976df981e0004e.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.poster.avif?t=1774924048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.webm?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.mp4?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a set of diverse levels representing the wide variety of climates and geographies found in Bargalia while hunting down members of the War Council. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in quick and primitive hack and slash game play. Collect weapons and cut down armies of Bargalian soldiers on your quest for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with a handful of demigods who now server under the ancient and all-powerful Talurbas, or pore over the scrolls you find on your travels for insight into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/991049d590c17c6e94976df981e0004e.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a plethora of handcrafted linear levels with distinct ambience and visual flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through hoards of soldiers, satyr, wizards and small animals using five distinct blades and powerful magical orbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light platforming and exploration segments intersperse a combat-focused game play loop.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read (or ignore) pages of written lore documents and dialogues with a roster of side characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a wispy and neurotic synth-fronted original soundtrack with songs themed to accompany each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a selection of six wearable hats during your campaign, or simply expose your bald green head to the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional high difficulty mode for people who like having one hit point.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/f9a13f5c1078d238b3a644717acd6965.avif?t=1774924048\" width=1000 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/1e758edc920b2c2ab6f8a6f69bb9e541.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/eef526f750e602e0f0d7299dde8d397a.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.poster.avif?t=1774924048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.webm?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/6671093940f4668475eb27c477494b29.mp4?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heir to the throne prince Vile has spent nine years imprisoned in the Underkeep on charge of Regicide. In that time, the Bargalian Empire has fallen into the hands of the War Council. Only now does an ancient and powerful being called Talurbas rise to bring about great upheaval. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/991049d590c17c6e94976df981e0004e.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.poster.avif?t=1774924048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.webm?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/716994c6377cce59017db086c1544a41.mp4?t=1774924048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a set of diverse levels representing the wide variety of climates and geographies found in Bargalia while hunting down members of the War Council. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in quick and primitive hack and slash game play. Collect weapons and cut down armies of Bargalian soldiers on your quest for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with a handful of demigods who now server under the ancient and all-powerful Talurbas, or pore over the scrolls you find on your travels for insight into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/991049d590c17c6e94976df981e0004e.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a plethora of handcrafted linear levels with distinct ambience and visual flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through hoards of soldiers, satyr, wizards and small animals using five distinct blades and powerful magical orbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light platforming and exploration segments intersperse a combat-focused game play loop.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read (or ignore) pages of written lore documents and dialogues with a roster of side characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a wispy and neurotic synth-fronted original soundtrack with songs themed to accompany each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a selection of six wearable hats during your campaign, or simply expose your bald green head to the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional high difficulty mode for people who like having one hit point.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/f9a13f5c1078d238b3a644717acd6965.avif?t=1774924048\" width=1000 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/extras/1e758edc920b2c2ab6f8a6f69bb9e541.avif?t=1774924048\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Bargalian Regicide is a stylized fantasy game about a disgraced prince in servitude of an ancient being. Cut through hundreds of soldiers to bring about change in a crumbling empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/bf60640ffb8e8956a472896ba30dcd02d77af9a1/header.jpg?t=1774924048", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/f3ccc36b1567ee1e9d84712e50b1e7780c238869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774924048", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158790/f3ccc36b1567ee1e9d84712e50b1e7780c2388